WEBVTT

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:37.360
Just before Kou Shuurei and the team of doctors arrived at Korin Castle,

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:44.700
Shi Ryuuki, the Emperor of Saiunkoku, received a report from Ran Shuuei, who had returned to Kiyou.

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:49.750
You have done well. Now go and rest, Shuuei.

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:05.640
They should be arriving at Korin Castle soon.

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:08.810
Ensei, please protect Shuurei.

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:27.370
Mayor Hei.

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:30.120
Will they really come?

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:31.540
They will.

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:33.840
I trust them.

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:44.560
What? The woman governor is coming?

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:46.100
Is that true?

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:49.940
Yeah, I heard soldiers talking about it with my very own ears!

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:53.940
If we let her in, the city will be overrun by that disease!

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:56.730
We mustn't let her in!

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:59.990
That's right! If she insists on entering, we'll just...

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:01.860
Yes, we'll slay her!

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:03.660
We won't let her in the castle, no matter what!

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:04.870
Hear, hear!

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:24.150
Coming, coming!

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:26.720
Apologies for visiting you so late at night.

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:08.810
Riou! Teach me how to write "Thank you."

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:09.810
Thank you?

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:11.890
Yes! I want to write it down!

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:30.330
Mom! It was there again!

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:42.300
Mom, are you in pain? Are you suffering?

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:52.020
Keep sleeping. You won't feel the pain like that.

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:59.060
If you die like this, then you won't suffer anymore.

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:05.860
Maybe you'd be happier that way.

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:09.830
We've come all the way from Sekiei Village,

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:13.410
but there are things that great people can't solve either.

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:18.750
Even so... I'm a little happier.

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:27.220
What am I saying? Don't think such stupid stuff!

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:30.100
Mom, bear with it for just a little longer.

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:31.970
They'll come and save us.

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:36.730
Eigetsu-onii-chan said that, so they will... surely...

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:58.580
Ensei, I'm counting on you!

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:02.110
Leave it to me! Hold on tight, Princess!

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:12.350
Mayor Hei!

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:13.180
This is serious!

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:15.220
What is it?

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:21.650
Bring my horse! Now!

00:06:29.650 --> 00:06:31.110
It's coming, Princess!

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:32.820
Ready!

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:39.250
Shoot!

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:44.880
Ensei!

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:48.340
Don't worry. I won't let them even scratch you!

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:52.300
I'm relying on you!

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:13.660
Old man Hei?

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:26.550
Ready!

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:36.760
Huh? Old man Hei?!

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:39.350
Wh-Wha... Stop! You're kidding!

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:40.290
Shoot!

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:41.850
M-Mayor?!

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:44.230
Wait! Stop! Stop!

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:15.050
That must be her.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:19.390
It's all her fault.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:35.410
Hey, old man!

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:38.030
You should act your age. Don't push yourself so hard!

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:56.300
Mayor Hei,

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:59.220
you have worked hard by yourself until now.

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:02.310
Thank you so much.

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:06.900
I have come to save people.

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:09.400
She's come to save us?

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:15.780
It was a woman's voice.

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:24.160
We were waiting for you.

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:34.760
You didn't desert the people of Koringun.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:37.180
I thank you from the bottom of my heart.

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:38.550
Mayor Hei...

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:40.010
Old man...

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:46.430
The lady who's coming here will definitely save us.

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:50.690
It's just as Eigetsu-onii-chan said! She's come!

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:52.650
Don't let her in the castle!

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:54.030
That's right!

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:55.650
Hear, hear!

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:56.150
Kill her!

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:59.570
Why? Why?!

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:05.250
Kill her...

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:16.630
Mayor Hei, please move away!

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:20.220
She's responsible for spreading the disease!

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:26.020
Who's he?

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:28.690
We've had enough!

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:31.230
What did we ever do to you?!

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:33.440
You've ruined everything!

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:38.610
How dare you come here after spreading such a gruesome illness!

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:41.530
This had never happened until you became governor!

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:44.490
It's all her fault!

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:45.370
Go home!

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:46.040
We won't let you in!

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:46.040
Go home!

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:07.390
The Mayor too! Letting all those sick people in!

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:10.350
This is a woman who can spread a mysterious disease.

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:13.900
She might be using witchcraft to control the mayor!

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:14.690
That's right!

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:16.110
Kill her!

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:17.070
He's being controlled!

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:20.820
W-Wait...

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:26.910
Don't. They'll claim that she's controlling you, no matter what you say.

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:34.750
If we let her into the city, dreadful things will happen!

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:37.170
We'll kill her now and calm the rage of the Sai Hassen!

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:40.470
That will take care of the disease and everything else!

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:43.840
We'll drag the people from Sekiei Village out and burn them!

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:45.100
That's the only way!

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:48.310
Would it've been better if we'd stayed in Sekiei Village?

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:53.480
If we'd all died there, we wouldn't have heard all this.

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:49.850
Kill them!

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:53.480
Burn them, and our villages will be safe!

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:01.030
Ensei...

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:04.570
I...

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:07.120
can't die here.

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:11.660
You're right.

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:15.580
In a moment, they'll say it's your fault if they get constipated!

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:20.340
I wish you'd come up with a better example.

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:22.800
You can't die, you said?

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:24.840
No, I can't die here.

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:28.810
There are things I can do, and things I must do.

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:30.470
I haven't saved anyone yet.

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:32.020
I can't die!

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:38.730
That lady really came to save us!

00:12:39.770 --> 00:12:41.610
Woman, how can you say that?!

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:43.820
You aren't even going to admit what you've done?!

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:47.450
If you die here, everything will be okay!

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:48.200
That's right!

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:49.410
Hear, hear!

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:56.460
Officer Rou, if we can stop the disease from spreading by taking this woman's life, we should do so.

00:12:57.080 --> 00:13:00.420
As an assistant to the governor, you should make the decision!

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:05.800
Well then, if the disease spreads in Korin Castle, what should I do?

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:10.600
Just as you said now, I can burn each and every one of you, right?

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:16.770
Guilty until proven innocent, that's what you're saying!

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:17.770
But...

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:23.530
Sure, it's an easy solution, but what about those who'll be burned?

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:27.780
Isn't it normal that the sick want to be saved?!

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:33.160
That's why the Princess found a way.

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:36.990
Though it was a difficult problem, she used her head,

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:40.750
risked her life, and ran everywhere to find treatment and doctors for you lot!

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:55.390
This is what it means to be saved!

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:57.480
It's not believing in some random rumor!

00:13:57.810 --> 00:14:00.270
Killing her won't save anyone!

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:08.450
If the same disease spreads again in the future, you won't have to burn the place down anymore!

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:12.950
Your precious wives and children, your future grandchildren and great-grandchildren will all be saved!

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:16.870
What do you think the Princess and Eigetsu came here to protect?

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.460
You still don't get it!

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:22.540
To protect all of you, including your futures!

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:34.010
Please, let me through!

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:36.560
I'll go see Jyasen-kyou myself eventually.

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:39.980
If my head is needed then, so be it!

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:43.400
But I don't have time now!

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:46.780
We came here to save people!

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:55.160
Hey, don't be fooled!

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:56.450
Shuon!

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:58.330
Just think about it!

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:02.040
What will you do if Jyasen-kyou was right?

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:05.420
If that woman is causing the sages' rage,

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:09.380
then no matter what she does, it's all a waste!

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:12.840
I'll do it, even if nobody else is with me.

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:16.510
If one woman's death will save everyone else's life, it's a good deal!

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:18.220
I'll do it!

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:26.110
Why? She said she'd come to save us.

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:27.730
Just hold on...

00:15:28.230 --> 00:15:30.780
Wait... She's finally come for us.

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:41.910
Why?

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:46.000
To kill a person... How could you say such a cruel thing?

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:48.840
Ensei...

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:52.680
Don't tell me you're gonna say, "Don't protect me."

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:54.300
How could I?

00:15:54.840 --> 00:15:56.390
Nothing is finished yet.

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:57.640
Very well.

00:16:10.490 --> 00:16:12.150
Stop this.

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:14.160
Stop it!

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:18.450
Stop it!

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:24.040
Why... Why are you doing this?!

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:25.580
She's finally come!

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:27.630
My dad and brothers have all died.

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:30.550
She's the only one who's trying to save my mom!

00:16:31.710 --> 00:16:32.320
Don't do this.

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:33.740
Just stop it!

00:16:34.210 --> 00:16:37.220
I don't want to see people die anymore!

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:54.280
You brat! This woman messed up your village!

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:56.410
Once we kill her, everything will be all right!

00:16:56.860 --> 00:17:01.040
No, it won't! That's a lie! Eigetsu-onii-chan said so!

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:05.160
The lady who's gonna come to my village will definitely save us!

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:06.500
Eigetsu?

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:09.840
We'll do our best, Shuurei-san!

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:12.590
Eigetsu-kun...

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:17.640
I trust Eigetsu-onii-chan.

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:24.180
He never gave up until the very last moment,
and was always thinking of ways to save people.

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:30.820
Kada, your spirit and wishes continue to be passed down, even after such a long time.

00:17:31.870 --> 00:17:33.150
You don't know anything.

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:37.700
You know nothing about how hard Eigetsu-onii-chan worked for us!

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:39.370
Shut up, brat!

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:44.000
I don't trust weirdos who say whatever they want and do nothing for us!

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:46.830
I don't trust murderers like you either!

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:52.750
I trust Eigetsu-onii-chan and the lady who actually came here!

00:17:55.800 --> 00:18:01.180
Onee-chan, please... save my mom.

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.940
It'll be all right.

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:21.740
Thank you for coming. Thank you.

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:27.370
It's all right.

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:32.710
Shut your annoying mouth!

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:35.710
I'll kill both you and the brat!

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:48.310
Out of the way!

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:51.810
Get out of the way, I said!

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:57.610
Mayor Hei!

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:07.290
We are all ready!

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:10.210
The doctors can start the treatment immediately.

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:14.130
The women have agreed to cooperate with us, as you commanded!

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:22.590
Several dozen women have memorized the stitching method that Master You described in his letter.

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:23.760
They are waiting.

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:26.390
You-sensei!

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:32.690
Nobody can ever care for the sick better than women.

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:36.610
What's going on?

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:37.820
What did he say?

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:39.150
You <i>idiots!</i>

00:19:39.610 --> 00:19:42.360
Stop acting like fools, and get out of the way!

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:43.660
Hey, hey, hey!

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:45.450
What's going on?

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:46.410
Honey!

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:52.040
Are you saying that if I or our children get sick, you're gonna kill us, just like this?

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:55.920
No way! I was just, for all of us...

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:58.670
Anyway, I wasn't planning to kill the doctors...

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:01.840
Stop joking.

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:07.140
How could you think you could show your face to me after killing that girl?

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:10.390
I don't want a husband who's a murderer!

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:12.390
B-But...

00:20:13.140 --> 00:20:15.900
Well, at first I didn't like it either.

00:20:16.270 --> 00:20:24.280
But then, I heard that a small girl had walked all the way from Sekiei Village for her mother.

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:27.870
I just thought, if I was in that situation...

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:33.290
if my children were sick, I'd try to save them, no matter what it took!

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:39.210
If someone said they could save us, I'd try it, no matter how slim the hope might be!

00:20:42.510 --> 00:20:45.970
Whatever the rumor says, I won't banish that hope!

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:52.230
While you fools were having that silly discussion, the officer visited our households one by one.

00:20:52.640 --> 00:20:54.600
He asked us very politely if we would help. He asked <i>us!</i>

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.440
Isn't that great?

00:20:57.440 --> 00:21:01.780
It means that if we're in trouble, they'll do the same for us, running around for help!

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:05.240
Then it's worth paying taxes!

00:21:08.570 --> 00:21:12.370
I'd be embarrassed as a woman if we said we wouldn't help, after all they've done for us.

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:16.420
Now, throw away what you've got in your hand!

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:17.790
But...

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:20.630
You still don't get it?!

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:23.010
You seem to take being alive for granted!

00:21:23.010 --> 00:21:25.300
Why don't you try giving birth for once?!

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:29.140
If you went through that, you'd never dream of killing a person ever again!

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:32.060
Isn't that right, girl?

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:34.640
Thank you very much.

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:36.690
You're so cool, aunty!

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:42.980
Now, out of the way!

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:45.360
There's plenty of work to do!

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:48.320
Before you get a kick in the ass, get going on your work!

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:53.740
Well then, let's go.

00:22:08.550 --> 00:22:10.260
So that's Kou Shuurei.

00:22:13.850 --> 00:22:17.600
Shuuran, you're such an idiot, to be so reckless.

00:22:18.520 --> 00:22:19.100
Riou!

00:22:20.100 --> 00:22:23.070
If you were watching, why didn't you help me?!

00:22:24.150 --> 00:22:26.650
Just how was I supposed to help you?

00:22:26.650 --> 00:22:30.160
Now, now, don't start fighting. Be nice to each other.

00:22:33.080 --> 00:22:35.370
Thank you for the rice balls and everything.

00:22:42.170 --> 00:22:42.920
That's...

00:22:44.430 --> 00:22:47.590
We're the ones who need to thank you.

00:22:48.010 --> 00:22:51.510
Thank you for shaking those fools awake.

00:22:52.800 --> 00:22:54.890
Now, let's do our best!

00:23:05.900 --> 00:23:08.280
Seriously, you're such a crybaby.

00:24:45.290 --> 00:24:46.920
Sorry for making you all wait so long!

00:24:47.460 --> 00:24:48.540
We'll start the surgery now!

00:24:49.100 --> 00:24:51.840
Doctors, show us what you've learned during your training!

00:24:52.840 --> 00:24:55.840
What?! After all that, you're scared now to try surgery on humans?!
